{"id":"d5e64f0c882e3eee","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-colimit.md","title":"Colimit","display":"df-colimit — Colimit","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-colimit","aliases":["58-df-colimit","Colimit"],"display":"df-colimit — Colimit","depends_on":["[[../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-functor.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-category-data.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-colimit"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-colimit</span><span>Colimit</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-colimit — Colimit"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8790486ac053461c\" href=\"?note=8790486ac053461c\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md\">../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"877f1061e295cf5f\" href=\"?note=877f1061e295cf5f\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-functor.md\">../batch18/58-df-functor.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e637becf421e4e61\" href=\"?note=e637becf421e4e61\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md\">../batch04/58-df-category-data.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,\\mathcal C,D,L,Y,\\iota,\\phi\\in V\">\\(I,\\mathcal C,D,L,Y,\\iota,\\phi\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li>对任意六元组范畴码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A\">\\(\\mathcal A\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal A),\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal A),s_{\\mathcal A},t_{\\mathcal A},\\circ_{\\mathcal A},e_{\\mathcal A}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal A),\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal A),s_{\\mathcal A},t_{\\mathcal A},\\circ_{\\mathcal A},e_{\\mathcal A}\\)</span> 分别表示其六个规范投影</li>\n<li>对函子码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_0\">\\(D_0\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_1\">\\(D_1\\)</span> 分别表示其对象映射和态射映射</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S\\)</span>（范畴结构谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8790486ac053461c\" href=\"?note=8790486ac053461c\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md\">../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Functor}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Functor}_S\\)</span>（函子谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"877f1061e295cf5f\" href=\"?note=877f1061e295cf5f\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-functor.md\">../batch18/58-df-functor.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span>（函数谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cocone}_S,\\mathrm{Colimit}_S,\\mathrm{UniversalCocone}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{Cocone}_S,\\mathrm{Colimit}_S,\\mathrm{UniversalCocone}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span>（此处定义的谓词）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}colimit\\text{-}cocone}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Cocone}_S(\\mathcal C,I,D,L,\\iota)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(I)\n\\land\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(D,I,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\bigl(\\iota,\\operatorname{Ob}(I),\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\bigr)\n\\land L\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(I)\\;\n\\bigl(s_{\\mathcal C}(\\iota(i))=D_0(i)\\land t_{\\mathcal C}(\\iota(i))=L\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(I)\\;\n\\bigl(\\iota(t_I(a))\\circ_{\\mathcal C}D_1(a)=\\iota(s_I(a))\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}colimit\\text{-}cocone}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Cocone}_S(\\mathcal C,I,D,L,\\iota)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(I)\n\\land\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(D,I,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\bigl(\\iota,\\operatorname{Ob}(I),\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\bigr)\n\\land L\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(I)\\;\n\\bigl(s_{\\mathcal C}(\\iota(i))=D_0(i)\\land t_{\\mathcal C}(\\iota(i))=L\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(I)\\;\n\\bigl(\\iota(t_I(a))\\circ_{\\mathcal C}D_1(a)=\\iota(s_I(a))\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}colimit}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Colimit}_S(\\mathcal C,I,D,L,\\iota)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cocone}_S(\\mathcal C,I,D,L,\\iota)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\forall\\phi\\in V\\;\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Cocone}_S(\\mathcal C,I,D,Y,\\phi)\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\exists!\\psi\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\;\n\\bigl(s_{\\mathcal C}(\\psi)=L\\land t_{\\mathcal C}(\\psi)=Y\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{49mm}\\land\\forall i\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(I)\\;\n(\\psi\\circ_{\\mathcal C}\\iota(i)=\\phi(i))\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}colimit}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Colimit}_S(\\mathcal C,I,D,L,\\iota)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cocone}_S(\\mathcal C,I,D,L,\\iota)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\forall\\phi\\in V\\;\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Cocone}_S(\\mathcal C,I,D,Y,\\phi)\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\exists!\\psi\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\;\n\\bigl(s_{\\mathcal C}(\\psi)=L\\land t_{\\mathcal C}(\\psi)=Y\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{49mm}\\land\\forall i\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(I)\\;\n(\\psi\\circ_{\\mathcal C}\\iota(i)=\\phi(i))\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}colimit\\text{-}universal\\text{-}cocone\\text{-}alias}\\vdash \\mathrm{UniversalCocone}_S(\\mathcal C,I,D,L,\\iota)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Colimit}_S(\\mathcal C,I,D,L,\\iota)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}colimit\\text{-}universal\\text{-}cocone\\text{-}alias}\\vdash \\mathrm{UniversalCocone}_S(\\mathcal C,I,D,L,\\iota)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Colimit}_S(\\mathcal C,I,D,L,\\iota)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\">\\(\\iota\\)</span> 与每个测试族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi\">\\(\\phi\\)</span> 都由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> 守卫；分量的源、靶以及自然性统一使用函子码的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_0,D_1\">\\(D_0,D_1\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>余极限是 cocone 范畴的初对象；唯一性量化只覆盖从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 到测试顶点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span> 的态射。</li>\n<li>coproduct、pushout 与 direct limit 是特定形状图式的余极限，应在各自原子中作为派生实例处理。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Mac Lane, Categories for the Working Mathematician</li>\n<li>Weibel, An Introduction to Homological Algebra</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md","status":"resolved","id":"8790486ac053461c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-functor.md","status":"resolved","id":"877f1061e295cf5f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-functor.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"e637becf421e4e61","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-category-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md","status":"resolved","id":"8790486ac053461c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S$（范畴结构谓词，见 [[../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-functor.md","status":"resolved","id":"877f1061e295cf5f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Functor}_S$（函子谓词，见 [[../batch18/58-df-functor.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$（函数谓词，见 [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"I,\\mathcal C,D,L,Y,\\iota,\\phi\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal A),\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal A),s_{\\mathcal A},t_{\\mathcal A},\\circ_{\\mathcal A},e_{\\mathcal A}","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"D_0","display":false},{"tex":"D_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Functor}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cocone}_S,\\mathrm{Colimit}_S,\\mathrm{UniversalCocone}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}colimit\\text{-}cocone}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Cocone}_S(\\mathcal C,I,D,L,\\iota)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(I)\n\\land\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(D,I,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\bigl(\\iota,\\operatorname{Ob}(I),\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\bigr)\n\\land L\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall i\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(I)\\;\n\\bigl(s_{\\mathcal C}(\\iota(i))=D_0(i)\\land t_{\\mathcal C}(\\iota(i))=L\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall a\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(I)\\;\n\\bigl(\\iota(t_I(a))\\circ_{\\mathcal C}D_1(a)=\\iota(s_I(a))\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}colimit}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Colimit}_S(\\mathcal C,I,D,L,\\iota)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Cocone}_S(\\mathcal C,I,D,L,\\iota)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\forall\\phi\\in V\\;\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Cocone}_S(\\mathcal C,I,D,Y,\\phi)\\to\\\\\n&\\qquad\\exists!\\psi\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\;\n\\bigl(s_{\\mathcal C}(\\psi)=L\\land t_{\\mathcal C}(\\psi)=Y\\\\\n&\\hspace{49mm}\\land\\forall i\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(I)\\;\n(\\psi\\circ_{\\mathcal C}\\iota(i)=\\phi(i))\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}colimit\\text{-}universal\\text{-}cocone\\text{-}alias}\\vdash \\mathrm{UniversalCocone}_S(\\mathcal C,I,D,L,\\iota)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Colimit}_S(\\mathcal C,I,D,L,\\iota)","display":true},{"tex":"\\iota","display":false},{"tex":"\\phi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"D_0,D_1","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"Y","display":false}],"bytes":2924,"backlinks":[{"id":"4b4cc773d6acdba5","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Colimit}_S\\subseteq V^5$ (see [[58-df-colimit]])"},{"id":"ec618d8943f0ce2c","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Colimit}_S$ (colimit-cocone predicate, see [[58-df-colimit]])"},{"id":"50b20f786d960883","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,Y)=\\mathrm{CatHom}_S(\\mathcal C,X,Y)$；$\\mathrm{Colimit}_S(\\mathcal C,J,D,L,\\iota)$ 来自 [[../batch17/58-df-colimit.md]]。"},{"id":"5d5e197234e9b36c","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{Colimit}$ 取 [[../batch17/58-df-colimit.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。"},{"id":"08a6ddab7f132c97","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"Colimit: universal object receiving consistent maps from all $X_i$; see [[../batch17/58-df-colimit.md]]."},{"id":"ad4584ff31c14758","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Colimit}_S(\\mathcal C,J,F,c,\\lambda)$ (five-place colimit-cocone predicate, see [[58-df-colimit]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-314","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-colimit.md|58-df-colimit]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["8790486ac053461c","877f1061e295cf5f","36d7463d215be751","e637becf421e4e61"]}